                "headline": "Wind Advisory issued November 24 at 8:50AM AKST until November 24 at 3:00PM AKST by NWS Juneau AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Southeast winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 45 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Annette Island, Ketchikan Gateway Borough, and Prince of\nWales Island.\n\n* WHEN...Until 3 PM AKST this afternoon.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...East to northeast winds will shift southeast\nduring the late morning as the front moves north of the area.",
